[13.213, "o", "==============================================================\r\n"]
[13.248, "o", " HailBytes -- AWS preflight (ha tier, us-east-1)\r\n"]
[13.283, "o", "==============================================================\r\n"]
[13.318, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.353, "o", "Account : 123456789012\r\n"]
[13.388, "o", "Identity: arn:aws:iam::123456789012:user/admin\r\n"]
[13.423, "o", "Region  : us-east-1\r\n"]
[13.458, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.493, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[13.528, "o", " Service-linked roles\r\n"]
[13.563, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[13.598, "o", "  rds.amazonaws.com              already exists (AWSServiceRoleForRDS)\r\n"]
[13.633, "o", "  elasticache.amazonaws.com      does not exist yet\r\n"]
[13.668, "o", "  elasticloadbalancing.amazonaws.com already exists (AWSServiceRoleForElasticLoadBalancing)\r\n"]
[13.703, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.738, "o", "Creating 1 service-linked role(s). This is a one-time,\r\n"]
[13.773, "o", "account-scoped, non-billable change.\r\n"]
[13.808, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.843, "o", "  creating elasticache.amazonaws.com      done\r\n"]
[28.248, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[28.283, "o", " Marketplace subscription\r\n"]
[28.318, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[28.353, "o", "Checking both listings, since this script does not know which product\r\n"]
[28.388, "o", "you intend to deploy:\r\n"]
[28.423, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.458, "o", "  sat  published in us-east-1 (ami-0123456789abcdef0)\r\n"]
[28.493, "o", "       subscribe: https://aws.amazon.com/marketplace/pp/prodview-yyk6iton3ghu4\r\n"]
[28.528, "o", "  asm  published in us-east-1 (ami-0fedcba9876543210)\r\n"]
[28.563, "o", "       subscribe: https://aws.amazon.com/marketplace/pp/prodview-66d5bswmbtfhs\r\n"]
[28.598, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.633, "o", "A visible AMI means the product is published in this region. It does NOT\r\n"]
[28.668, "o", "prove this account is subscribed: Marketplace AMIs are visible to every\r\n"]
[28.703, "o", "account, and a missing subscription only shows at launch, as OptInRequired\r\n"]
[28.738, "o", "partway through the apply. Confirm on the listing page (it says you are\r\n"]
[28.773, "o", "subscribed) or under AWS Marketplace > Manage subscriptions.\r\n"]
[28.808, "o", "\u001b[2m  ...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[41.708, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[41.743, "o", " EC2 vCPU quota (informational)\r\n"]
[41.778, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[41.813, "o", "The ha tier builds 2 application instance(s) at\r\n"]
[41.848, "o", "m6i.2xlarge (8 vCPUs each), so it needs 16 vCPUs\r\n"]
[41.883, "o", "of Standard on-demand quota here.\r\n"]
[41.918, "o", "\r\n"]
[41.953, "o", "Running On-Demand Standard (A/C/D/H/I/M/R/T/Z) instance vCPU limit in\r\n"]
[41.988, "o", "us-east-1: 64.0\r\n"]
[42.023, "o", "  At or above the 16 vCPUs this tier needs. Note this is the\r\n"]
[42.058, "o", "  LIMIT, not the headroom: other running instances count against it\r\n"]
[42.093, "o", "  and Service Quotas does not report current consumption.\r\n"]
[42.128, "o", "\r\n"]
[42.163, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[42.198, "o", " Elastic IPs and VPCs in us-east-1\r\n"]
[42.233, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[42.268, "o", "  Elastic IPs: 3 used of 5 -- this deployment needs 2.\r\n"]
[42.303, "o", "  VPCs       : 1 used of 5 -- this deployment needs 1.\r\n"]
[42.338, "o", "\u001b[2m  ...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[42.373, "o", "==============================================================\r\n"]
[42.408, "o", " Preflight complete for the ha tier.\r\n"]
